# Pawpatch Recruit: "a creature you control ... an opponent controls". Bot1 bolts its own Elves on turn 5 (an ability controlled by
# Bot1 itself, not an opponent) and then, with Bot2's Elves in play, bolts those: neither puts a counter on anything. Bot2's
# Bolt on Bot1's Elves in scenario one is the positive control.

